# cad_processor/_acc_*   generierte Accuracy-Reports/-Logs der CAD-Pipeline (_acc_out.txt, _acc_err.log)
# *.pre-merge.bak  versehentliche Merge-Backups
.cache/
cad_processor/_acc_*
*.pre-merge.bak
